      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "The default graphics level has been swapped to Ultra. Ultra has shadow cascades set to 4 and shadow distance set to 150, versus High which has half that value on both.\nThose who have used the Open Beta will have to re-set their value to Ultra upon release.\nWe eventually plan on providing more granular graphical controls in the application (which will solve this issue more precisely) but do not have an ETA on this change.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
